= Playtest Feedback — Layer 3: Bodyguard Rule Fix

_One form per player. Fill out independently after the game._

#note-box[In this layer, a Guard only needs to be *adjacent to the defender* to intercept (baseline requires adjacent to both attacker AND defender). The Guard takes the damage instead of the original target. Attacker moves 1 tile.]

